8,"Chin, Senthang language. Evangelism tools, church planting...",https://globalrecordings.net/en/language/sez,"Download Chin Senthang - The Two Roads.mp3. Audio recordings available in Chin, Senthang. These recordings are designed for evangelism and basic Bible teaching to bring the gospel message to people who are not literate or are from oral cultures, particularly unreached people groups.","Chin, Senthang",Sino-Tibetan
9,Languages by language family/Kuki-Chin - translatewiki.net,https://translatewiki.net/wiki/Languages_by_language_family/Kuki-Chin,"Sino-Tibetan languages Tibeto-Burmese languages Kuki-Chin-Naga languages. Senthang Chin (or Senthang, Hsemtang, Hsemtung) [sez]. Zotung Chin (or Zotung, Bandzhogi, Bandžogi, Banjogi, Zobya) [czt].","Chin, Senthang",Sino-Tibetan
